    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39089" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">prosthĕsis</span></b> , is,
		f., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρόσθεσις</span>, and <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">prŏthĕsis</span></b> ,
